Level 1 : Building software that behaves safely in the presence of real humans.
Learnings:
# State Awareness (FeedBack to user at every step)
# Guarding the System (Assume user will do wrong things)
# Feedback & Communication (user must never wonder: "did it worked?") (state awareness is solution)
# Ownership Thinking (Know what will happen exactly at each step when a user comes in)
# Reliability over Features (Anyone can implement 10 features but can you make any one super relaible?)

💎 Real truth
Level 1 is small in code.
But HUGE in engineering philosophy.

